0,0.0,3.333,"Full shot of C1 falling through the air behind a bunch of berries, pulling back.","P4: Mountain slope and rocky peaks. Outdoor, bright daytime high in the air above snow-covered jagged mountain peaks under a blue sky.",,A large bunch of red berries on a green stem floating in the foreground.,"C1 blinks its large eyes, and then falls slightly backward into the lower-left distance with a wide, eager smile while reaching its front hooves toward a bunch of red berries drifting into the upper-right foreground.",Close-up on C1's face pulling back to a wide shot as the berries enter the foreground on the right; high angle looking slightly down.,"Bright, clear daylight with cool blue and white mountain tones contrasted by warm orange fur and vibrant red berries; comedic, triumphant mood.","Rushing wind, a comedic vocal groan from C1, and triumphant, fast-paced orchestral brass and string music resuming."
